@startuml
title Schlagzähler Pico – Companion Protocol & Inter-Core Event Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

box "Companion Web Application" #E8F5E9
    participant "Angular Web App\n(Web Serial)" as Web
end box

box "Pico W – Core 1 (Display & I/O)" #E3F2FD
    participant "CompanionProtocol\n(Core 1)" as Proto
    participant "CommandHandler\n(Core 1)" as CmdH
end box

box "Inter-Core Queues (OSAL)" #FFF3E0
    queue "queue_core1_to_core0\n(Capacity: 8)" as Q10
    queue "queue_core0_to_core1\n(Capacity: 16)" as Q01
end box

box "Pico W – Core 0 (Game & Sensing)" #F3E5F5
    participant "App\n(Core 0)" as App0
    participant "GameController\n(Core 0)" as GC
    participant "HitDetector\n(Core 0)" as HD
end box

== 1. Device Boot & Handshake ==

HD -> Q01: Core0ToCore1Message\n(MSG_BOOT_STATUS: success=true, msg="OK")
activate HD
deactivate HD
Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>BOOT success=1 msg=OK</b>
deactivate Proto

Web -> Proto: <b>STATUS</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_status()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_REQUEST_STATUS)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_REQUEST_STATUS)
deactivate App0
activate GC
GC -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (ARMED)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=READY, new=READY)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_MODE_CHANGED (active=COUNT, param=0)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=0)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

loop Drain Core 0 Status Updates
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core0_to_core1)
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>SENSOR status=ARMED</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>STATE old=READY new=READY</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>MODE active=COUNT param=0</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>SCORE value=0</b>
    deactivate Proto
end

== 2. Sensor Calibration Workflow ==

Web -> Proto: <b>CALIB</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_calibration()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_REQUEST_CALIBRATION)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop(&queue_core1_to_core0)
activate App0
App0 -> HD: HitDetector_start_calibration()
activate HD
App0 -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (CALIBRATING)
deactivate App0
deactivate HD

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>SENSOR status=CALIBRATING</b>
deactivate Proto

note over HD, App0: Core 0 collects 10'000 ADC samples (1500 ms)\nComputes baseline, noise, and base_threshold

HD -> Q01: MSG_CALIBRATION_RESULT (success=1, baseline=512, noise=14, threshold=568)
HD -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (ARMED)

loop Drain Calibration Result & Arming
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>CALIB success=1 baseline=512 noise=14 threshold=568</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>SENSOR status=ARMED</b>
    deactivate Proto
end

== 3. Game Configuration Workflow ==

Web -> Proto: <b>MODE:TIMED</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_set_mode(GAME_MODE_TIMED)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_SET_GAME_MODE: mode=TIMED)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop()
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_SET_GAME_MODE)
deactivate App0
activate GC
GC -> GC: Set active_mode = TIMED, param = 30s
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_MODE_CHANGED (active=TIMED, param=30)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MODE active=TIMED param=30</b>
deactivate Proto

Web -> Proto: <b>PARAM:45</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_set_parameter(45)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_SET_GAME_PARAMETER: param=45)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop()
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_SET_GAME_PARAMETER)
activate GC
GC -> GC: Set parameter = 45s
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_MODE_CHANGED (active=TIMED, param=45)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>MODE active=TIMED param=45</b>
deactivate Proto

== 4. Game Execution & Real-Time Hit Telemetry ==

Web -> Proto: <b>START</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_start()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_START_GAME)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop()
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_START_GAME)
activate GC
GC -> GC: GameController_start() (state: READY -> RUNNING)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=READY, new=RUNNING)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=0)
GC -> Q01: MSG_TIMER_CHANGED (elapsed=0, remaining=45000)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

loop Drain Start Notifications
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>STATE old=READY new=RUNNING</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>SCORE value=0</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>TIMER elapsed=0 remaining=45000</b>
    deactivate Proto
end

note over HD: Piezo ADC DMA buffer triggers HitDetector\nSample exceeds dynamic threshold!
HD -> GC: GameController_on_hit(hit_event)
activate GC
GC -> GC: score++ (score = 1)
GC -> Q01: MSG_HIT_DETECTED (id=1, peak=1840, intensity=1272)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=1)
deactivate GC

loop Drain Hit & Score Update
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>HIT id=1 peak=1840 intensity=1272</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>SCORE value=1</b>
    deactivate Proto
end

note over GC: Periodic 100 ms Tick (GameController_tick)
GC -> Q01: MSG_TIMER_CHANGED (elapsed=1000, remaining=44000)
Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>TIMER elapsed=1000 remaining=44000</b>
deactivate Proto

== 5. Game Finish Condition & Reset ==

note over GC: Timer reaches 0 ms (TIME_LIMIT reached)
GC -> GC: GameController_finish(GAME_END_TIME_LIMIT)
activate GC
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_FINISHED (final_score=24, total_time_ms=45000, reason=TIME_LIMIT)
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=RUNNING, new=FINISHED)
deactivate GC

loop Drain Finish Notifications
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>RESULT score=24 time_ms=45000 reason=TIME_LIMIT</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>STATE old=RUNNING new=FINISHED</b>
    deactivate Proto
end

Web -> Proto: <b>RESET</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_reset()
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_RESET_GAME)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop()
activate App0
App0 -> GC: GameController_on_command(MSG_RESET_GAME)
activate GC
GC -> GC: Reset score & state: FINISHED -> READY
GC -> Q01: MSG_GAME_STATE_CHANGED (old=FINISHED, new=READY)
GC -> Q01: MSG_SCORE_CHANGED (score=0)
deactivate GC
deactivate App0

loop Drain Reset Notifications
    Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
    activate Proto
    Proto --> Web: <b>STATE old=FINISHED new=READY</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>SCORE value=0</b>
    deactivate Proto
end

== 6. High-Speed Raw Signal Capture & Streaming ==

Web -> Proto: <b>CAPTURE</b>
activate Proto
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_capture(enable=true)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: OsalQueue_push(MSG_REQUEST_CAPTURE: enable=true)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

Q10 -> App0: OsalQueue_pop()
activate App0
App0 -> HD: HitDetector_start_capture()
activate HD
App0 -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (CAPTURE_ARMED)
deactivate HD
deactivate App0

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>SENSOR status=CAPTURE_ARMED</b>
deactivate Proto

note over HD: Physical hit occurs!\nPre-trigger buffer (1'000 samples) locked.\nPost-trigger buffer (20'000 samples) records for 2.0 s.
HD -> Q01: MSG_SENSOR_STATUS_CHANGED (CAPTURING)
Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto --> Web: <b>SENSOR status=CAPTURING</b>
deactivate Proto

note over HD: Capture completes (total 21'000 samples at 10 kHz)
HD -> Q01: MSG_CAPTURE_READY (rate=10000, pre=1000, count=21000, samples=ptr)
activate HD
deactivate HD

Q01 -> Proto: OsalQueue_pop()
activate Proto
Proto -> Proto: Set capture_tx_active = true, offset = 0
Proto --> Web: <b>CAPTURE_START rate=10000 pre=1000 count=21000 ...</b>

loop Non-Blocking Transmission across Core 1 Ticks (50 samples per line)
    Proto -> Proto: CompanionProtocol_tick_capture_tx()
    Proto --> Web: <b>CAPTURE_DATA offset=0 values=512,514,...</b>
    Proto --> Web: <b>CAPTURE_DATA offset=... values=...</b>
end

Proto --> Web: <b>CAPTURE_END count=21000</b>
Proto -> CmdH: CommandHandler_handle_request_capture(enable=false)
activate CmdH
CmdH -> Q10: MSG_REQUEST_CAPTURE (enable=false)
deactivate CmdH
deactivate Proto

@enduml
